#. module: eh_account_fx_revaluation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:eh_account_fx_revaluation.view_eh_fx_rate_config_form
msgid ""
"Central-bank sources (ECB, Bank of Canada, National Bank of Poland, Bank of "
"Russia, Central Bank of Turkey, Reserve Bank of Australia, Central Bank of "
"Brazil, HMRC) publish against their own base currency and need no API key; "
"cross-rates into the company currency are derived automatically. Aggregator "
"sources serve broad coverage and some require an API key in the field above."
" The Manual provider disables automatic fetch so finance enters rates by "
"hand into Currencies &gt; Rates."
msgstr ""
"Les sources des banques centrales (ECB, Bank of Canada, National Bank of "
"Poland, Bank of Russia, Central Bank of Turkey, Reserve Bank of Australia, "
"Central Bank of Brazil, HMRC) publient dans leur propre devise de base et ne"
" nécessitent aucune clé API ; les taux croisés vers la devise de la société "
"sont dérivés automatiquement. Les sources agrégatrices offrent une large "
"couverture et certaines nécessitent une clé API dans le champ ci-dessus. Le "
"fournisseur Manual désactive la récupération automatique afin que la finance"
" saisisse les taux à la main dans Currencies &gt; Rates."

